                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Page sits on $ds-bg. Main column is $ds-surface-inset. Cards and tables are $ds-surface-deep; the selected row is $ds-surface. Never stack two surface tones in one block.",
